<ul style=3D"line-height:150%"></ul>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><span style=3D"font-weight: bold; font-size: =
22px;">America=E2=80=99s bean king is thriving amid the protein craze</span=
><br><br></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">One of the hottest clubs in America today doe=
sn=E2=80=99t serve cocktails or require a dress code, though it does charge=
 a cover and has a pretty long line of people trying to get in.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">The club in question: The Rancho Gordo Bean C=
lub, a private subscription-based group with 30k members =E2=80=94 and a wa=
itlist of 29k people stewing for entry, <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.co=
m/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VWvLN_8sPf3FW4z4Pjt4xQNW2W4YmM-15JwRG0N5_C1nY2-ZW=
0W95jsWP6lZ3l9W4VxThb9hP6XwW52L7YR5Gwm7dW4g8bqb34YyS1W6H7j648jBX1dW3_TR052N=
cHN1W8N0GWJ3zRTfYW7v4nfN6DmhMKW7RfZxB1qZdp1W1P99NZ8Ll86dW5pJXfh3-plfcW2Rgkp=
P2ttJ1hW16Yf4T3WZSd9W3HrxzY8LjgMBW57SGvK6BPXgjW1GHD3l8S0l3ZW624p9-2f5LryW2W=
SzSL5vRRYmW1QqBFV4mpgV5N6443J4LtFL-W1xryBQ6L4QvLW2NJZdY4rwLLvW7PY9l31hHNVXW=
8_x_9v810P_yN27N0hccK6vgMRN8SQlTfH-W1fk0JV2HXbSRW6S9k7m12knw5W7RB6r51zk-41W=
5lPK7C4SMHHCW6PJxvJ2SgjXNf6HVC2R04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=
=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"t1gxt6Mu" target=3D"_blank">per</a> <span styl=
e=3D"font-style: italic;">The Wall Street Journal </span>=E2=80=94 who pay =
$200 a year for quarterly deliveries of one trendy yet humble commodity=E2=
=80=A6 beans.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%; font-weight:bold; font-size:18px">But these a=
ren=E2=80=99t just any beans=E2=80=A6&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">They=E2=80=99re high-quality heirloom beans f=
rom Steve Sando, the so-called bean king, whose 40+ dry varieties, includin=
g unique ones like Christmas lima beans, cost ~$7.50 a pound.&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Unlike cheaper commodity beans found at super=
markets, these ones are fresher, meaning they cook faster and, most importa=
ntly, taste better.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">He founded bean company Rancho Gordo in 2001,=
 back when legumes were considered cool to few beyond Sando himself, but hi=
s obsession is finally paying off.&nbsp;</p>
<ul style=3D"line-height:150%">
<li aria-level=3D"1">Since 2019, Rancho Gordo=E2=80=99s sales have tripled,=
 per<em> WSJ</em>.&nbsp;<br><br></li>
<li aria-level=3D"1">Today, the company sells 2.5m pounds of beans each yea=
r.</li>
</ul>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%; font-weight:bold; font-size:18px">The big bea=
n economy</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">While beans have long had a bad rap, associat=
ed with poverty and flatulence, <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ct=
c/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VWvLN_8sPf3FW4z4Pjt4xQNW2W4YmM-15JwRG0N5_C1n22-ZW0W7lCdLW=
6lZ3lQW75dBgr58VKp-W1wk7TX2mwHSWW9bYYhq17FHZwW2tJ1tf3SkmkTW54tzwJ2dyNnmW3Zz=
P9-40hzTfW3W2y6-6yBvnVW24pYYk26bh1wV4BDpP23qcmFW7JcYwZ988zM5Vqz1Xp85CQF5W3f=
p7c927yjJlN2Y8hn1q_Xl0W53WFqd8S568PW4JBV001xzC9gVfDWRZ7w6CT3W7pjtQZ8DhcRZW5=
Dllr07PjpRJW7_FKh661rs_RW1hkGKh2JWxV2W88bkgP3c7B0mW1Y-nsd6Yrg17W5jPZHj769h5=
XV8Q-2m8hFffQdzHSF004" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-h=
s-link-id-v2=3D"jqWKbzyp" target=3D"_blank">particularly</a> in the US, the=
 magical fruit that makes you toot is high in protein and fiber, low in cal=
ories, and cheap. Which is why they=E2=80=99ve become so popular among heal=
th- and budget-conscious Americans in recent years.&nbsp;</p>
<ul style=3D"line-height:150%">
<li aria-level=3D"1">US bean <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/U=
B+113/d2q-Vf04/VWvLN_8sPf3FW4z4Pjt4xQNW2W4YmM-15JwRG0N5_C1n22-ZW0W7lCdLW6lZ=
